as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"},". If successful, the enemy Starfighter must stop moving.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Consequences of Dogfighting"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," engaged in a Dogfight must select the Dogfight Action on every turn, and it cannot move out of its current square until it Disengages (see below). While engaged in a Dogfight, you cannot attack any target outside the Dogfight.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attacking in a Dogfight:"]}," Make an opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", if you succeed on the opposed check, you may make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Attack"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["If you fail, you cannot attack the target, and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," take a -5 penalty on any attack rolls they make until your next turn."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Disengaging from a Dogfight:"]}," Make an opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", if you succeed on the opposed check, you successfully Disengage from the Dogfight, and may move a number of squares equal to your Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},".\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["If you fail, you remain in the Dogfight, and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," take a -5 penalty on any attack rolls they make until your next turn."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Firing into a Dogfight:"]}," If another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," fires into a Dogfight, it takes a -5 penalty on its attack roll, unless the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," has the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Precise Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Precise_Shot","referenceId":"reference:22a4f5aa2c7ad54d"}," feat."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
